    "sp_rich_text_grid_collums_WFPF97": {
      "type": "sp-rich-text-grid-collums",
      "blocks": {
        "text_K4kAeJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "alignment": "left",
            "text": "<p>Designed in collaboration with industry experts, and accredited by UK-based Teesside University, Hyper Island’s Master’s Degree programs are redefining business education by bringing learning and doing together in powerful new ways. </p><p>Learning at your own pace is a trend that we have experienced and is growing in popularity the world over. In collaboration with Grupa UNIS, Hyper Island are now proud to offer a co-created Level 7 / Master’s Level accredited course in <strong>Leading Digital Futures.</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "text_8djhxG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "alignment": "left",
            "text": "<p>Upon successful completion you will be awarded certification of an ‘Accredited CPD’ - this equates to a<strong> total of 10 credits at Level 7 (Master’s Level). </strong></p><p>Internationally recognised, you can take this certification into your CPD plan at work, as well as declare it upon application for a Master’s Degree Programme. </p><p>Use this opportunity to get a taste for a Hyper Island </p><p>MA in Digital Management. <a href=\"https://hyperisland.com/en/programs/master-degree?_gl=1*1ktgx39*_up*MQ..*_ga*ODU5MTg4Njg1LjE3NDM3ODAxMjI.*_ga_S2W3BWJ5VS*MTc0Mzc4MDEyMC4xLjAuMTc0Mzc4MDEyMC4wLjAuMA..\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Register your interest here to secure a place for September 2026. </span></a></p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_K4kAeJ",
        "text_8djhxG"
      ],
